571
00:27:51,961 --> 00:27:53,380
OPEN SECURITY: 1 SHARE
COYOTECH: 1 SHARE

572
00:27:53,463 --> 00:27:54,547
- For me…
- What did you buy?

573
00:27:54,631 --> 00:27:56,508
For now, I wanna buy a share
