574
00:27:56,591 --> 00:27:58,802
- Between CoyoTech and Analog Electronics--
- One won't make much of a difference.

575
00:27:58,885 --> 00:28:00,887
- No?
- You should pick two and commit.

576
00:28:00,970 --> 00:28:03,640
