- Do you have a plan?

577
00:28:03,723 --> 00:28:04,974
Go with Ent?

578
00:28:05,058 --> 00:28:06,434
- And then…
- It fits with your image.

579
00:28:06,518 --> 00:28:07,811
Ent and Electronics?

580
00:28:07,894 --> 00:28:09,062
Whatever you want.

581
00:28:09,145 --> 00:28:10,814
I'm putting 50,000 won into each of them.

582
00:28:10,897 --> 00:28:12,190
Then I'll go for something else.

583
00:28:13,441 --> 00:28:15,902
Should I go for Capital

584
00:28:16,611 --> 00:28:18,321
and Steel?

585
00:28:18,405 --> 00:28:23,785
I think we must avoid
everyone flocking to the same stock.

586
00:28:23,868 --> 00:28:25,453
Some people have to sit out.

587
00:28:25,537 --> 00:28:27,747
- We need to track different scenarios.
- Then…

588
00:28:27,831 --> 00:28:30,458
- Right, if we all do something different,
- Yeah.

589
00:28:30,542 --> 00:28:33,628
Round 1 might be a good time
to share information.

590
00:28:33,712 --> 00:28:34,796
Do what now?

591
00:28:34,879 --> 00:28:37,048
I went with Ent and Electronics.

592
00:28:37,132 --> 00:28:38,883
I went with five shares each
of Capital and Security.

593
00:28:38,967 --> 00:28:39,801
Five each?

594
00:28:39,884 --> 00:28:42,011
