- But you don't need to go all in.

595
00:28:42,095 --> 00:28:43,555
- It's fine to buy just a little.
- Right.

596
00:28:43,638 --> 00:28:46,266
I think I'm gonna sit out Round 1
and get in at Round 2.

597
00:28:46,349 --> 00:28:47,642
- That should be fine.
- Yeah.

598
00:28:47,726 --> 00:28:50,437
We'd have to look at the trading volume
and price movement.

599
