651
00:30:54,018 --> 00:30:55,645
- Ten shares?
- So if I buy and sell right away--

652
00:30:55,728 --> 00:30:57,146
- That'd be meaningless.
- Yeah.

653
00:30:57,230 --> 00:31:01,234
No, the thing is, we predicted
that the buying volume--

654
00:31:01,317 --> 00:31:03,403
<i>That concludes Round 1.</i>

655
00:31:03,486 --> 00:31:04,988
<i>Round 2 will now begin.</i>

656
00:31:05,071 --> 00:31:05,905
