Who bought CoyoTech?

662
00:31:17,208 --> 00:31:18,418
Seok-jin earned 400 won.

663
00:31:18,501 --> 00:31:20,003
- He made 1,400 won.
- He did.

664
00:31:20,086 --> 00:31:22,130
He also bought one
that went down 1,000 won.

665
00:31:22,213 --> 00:31:24,173
But how did the sell on CoyoTech
