674
00:31:45,445 --> 00:31:46,779
11 SHARES BOUGHT, 10 SHARES SOLD

675
00:31:46,863 --> 00:31:48,656
- That's what we should be doing.
- Oh, I see.

676
00:31:48,740 --> 00:31:52,327
We still don't know the exact rule,
but we know it increases by 1,400 won

677
00:31:52,410 --> 00:31:55,872
