XITSUH, can you just buy and sell
CoyoTech a few times for us?

682
00:32:05,965 --> 00:32:07,800
Buy and sell CoyoTech a few times.

683
00:32:07,884 --> 00:32:08,968
Just a few times.

684
00:32:09,052 --> 00:32:12,388
CoyoTech has had
a lot of wash trading going on.

685
00:32:12,472 --> 00:32:14,098
Since the buy and sell numbers are high,

686
00:32:14,182 --> 00:32:16,100
