703
00:32:52,011 --> 00:32:54,013
Should someone try selling Banger Steel?

704
00:32:54,097 --> 00:32:55,515
Can anyone try selling it?

705
00:32:55,598 --> 00:32:56,766
I have shares.

706
00:32:56,849 --> 00:32:58,810
- Either one of you can do it.
- Let's sell one each.

707
00:32:58,893 --> 00:33:01,187
- Just one share each.
- Shall we sell one each?

708
00:33:01,270 --> 00:33:03,189
That way, the numbers won't get messy.

709
00:33:03,272 --> 00:33:05,900
I think it drops 200 won
every time someone buys,

